 mind, let's examine each function.\n\n- The function $U(x,y)$ is a vector field on ${R}^{2}.$ It maps every point in the set $S,$ given by\n\n$$\nS={(x,y)\\in {R}^{2}\\,|\\,x\\ne -2,\\,x-y\\ge 0}\n$$\n\nto a vector in ${R}^{2}.$\n\n- The function $V(x,y)$ is a vector field on ${R}^{2}.$ It maps every point $(x,y)\\in {R}^{2}$ to a vector in ${R}^{2}.$\n\n- The function $W(x,y,z)$ is *not* a vector field on ${R}^{2}.$ It is a vector field on ${R}^{3}.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and II only.\"" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-122650/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "019e5a17-1aab-565b-8881-447c86a9a7ec"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-122650"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} [:db/retract 17592186172217 :question/answer-fields 17592186168505] {:db/id "q-122697/selection/ma-v1/abf05f643328baef29799564f4c6148dae79a6cc2c1b40465267d88ff10715d2/5b26512916f768e66a2b0af106e5aa3e2ff7ee012277d9669a26d349c343f77b" :answer/id #uuid "a13322c1-bd19-5745-9ce5-206071413be6" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-122697/selection/ma-v1/abf05f643328baef29799564f4c6148dae79a6cc2c1b40465267d88ff10715d2/df67a18079e3b7b726c109ae1bf07ae161d9f6d37a928c50361c8787d74f7981" :answer/id #uuid "fb4baf47-36a1-5bab-ae66-249a87a32d44" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "II only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-122697/selection/ma-v1/abf05f643328baef29799564f4c6148dae79a6cc2c1b40465267d88ff10715d2/95f63c11f99a5015c1f73558576052145e00c1cfbb1718f78cf554be0ab200f9" :answer/id #uuid "70456547-98e0-5aec-b06b-f9018a44b3f6" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I and II only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-122697/selection/ma-v1/abf05f643328baef29799564f4c6148dae79a6cc2c1b40465267d88ff10715d2/431472f1dab61ef54de031c09a96fb6a21dc69c8bc09f12797d1d686e8c9e8e6" :answer/id #uuid "59117d6e-9073-527d-9d12-f676