$ is a function $F$ that maps every point $(x,y,z)\\in S$ to a vector $F(x,y,z)\\in {R}^{3}.$\n\nWith that in mind, let's examine each function.\n\n- The function $U(x,y,z)$ is a vector field on ${R}^{3}.$ It assigns every point in the set $S,$ given by\n\n$$\nS={(x,y,z)\\in {R}^{3}\\,|\\,x\\ge y,\\,z>0}\n$$\n\nto a vector in ${R}^{3}.$\n\n- The function $V(x,y)$ is *not* a vector field on ${R}^{3}.$ It assigns points in ${R}^{2}$ (not ${R}^{3}$) to vectors in ${R}^{2}$ (not ${R}^{3}$).\n\n- The function $W(t)$ is *not* a vector field on ${R}^{3}.$ It assigns points in $R$ (not ${R}^{3}$) to vectors in ${R}^{3}.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I only.\"" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-122697/selection/ma-v1/abf05f643328baef29799564f4c6148dae79a6cc2c1b40465267d88ff10715d2"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} [:db/retract 17592186172211 :question/answer-fields 17592186168469] {:db/id "q-122467/selection/ma-v1/1e034ba333380fd497aac5d9d00f4108374a5361300230d17a39836afbc21193/1e5815fe88f764dcffb6e1d4884bd91ce2c23cb2e4c57c2f2f99b70378aa1f23" :answer/id #uuid "1375d472-1f3e-5d83-b50f-685c2d76c8e4" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I, II, and III" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-122467/selection/ma-v1/1e034ba333380fd497aac5d9d00f4108374a5361300230d17a39836afbc21193/df67a18079e3b7b726c109ae1bf07ae161d9f6d37a928c50361c8787d74f7981" :answer/id #uuid "e1fd84d5-1fa6-59d3-a072-71e74f79bd6c" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "II only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-122467/selection/ma-v1/1e034ba333380fd497aac5d9d00f4108374a5361300230d17a39836afbc21193/6a87b4860f595a380edef797b2cc43b24d4896fc51da713259b980588721456c" :answer/id #uuid "b18e55a3-ca3f-54a2-aecc-f3d5701696d5" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-122467/selection/ma-v1/1e034ba333380fd497aac5d9d00f4108374a5361300230d17a39836afbc21193/1f1f2fe9df6485d5cdc7916416b2f79699d8